              Building intelligent automation systems that coordinate multiple AI services and workflows seamlessly.
            </p>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
              <span class="rounded-full border border-purple-500/30 bg-purple-500/20 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-purple-300"
